      "text": "Classify YELLOW (Delayed): Respirations <30/min, radial pulse present, capillary refill <2 seconds, can follow simple commands. Treatment and transport delayed",
      "evidence": { "page": 132, "source_text": "Yellow Delayed Treatment and transport delayed. Respirations less than 30/minute. Radial pulse present, capillary refill less than 2 seconds. And can follow simple commands." }
